  "description": "Hand-written: the audio.ground.* rows' own contract (PL.native-ground-row, U97(3); core's ground reading, PL.ground-from-ir, U94(5)) — the contract row's data, each row's answer shape, what core reads itself going to core unchecked (an absent world or a world that is not an object, an absent or non-finite position, an absent or unknown gait), the open ground a default and never a refusal, and an archetype read by its ancestor for the step. Core's own corpus (conformance/audio/ground.json, 48 cases) is driven whole through these rows by the audio_ground_corpus ctest (tests/props_corpus.cpp), not transcribed here.",
